            <ArticleTitle>An unusual complication during deployment of a Multi-Link stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>58-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of intracoronary stents has greatly impacted on the practice of interventional cardiology. Complications due to equipment failure during deployment of stents are rare but potentially serious. We report a case of a malfunctioning Multi-Link delivery system and the successful treatment of the resulting complications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
